  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Due to the difference in muscle width of a user’s legs compared to their arms, they can be more easily modified to host larger blades.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Popup Melee Weapon (Cyberleg) Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> The Popup Melee Weapon can now accept a One-Handed Very Heavy Melee Weapon (that need not be concealable before its installation) provided by the user (along with any attachments or mods it has). Additionally, whenever the user is in a Grapple, if they attack an opponent in the grapple with the enhanced Popup Melee Weapon and cause a Critical Injury, it deals 5 additional Bonus Damage (10 Total).</p>\n<p><em>NOTE: Based on what James Norris and a Tyger Claw use in Cyberpunk: Edgerunners.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Popup Melee Weapon (Cyberleg)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberlegs).</em></p>"
